            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><table class=\"ips-section\"><thead><tr><th>Problem</th><th>Status</th><th>Onset</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sensation of pain: MILD impairment</td><td>Active</td><td>14-Nov 24</td></tr><tr class=\"ips-follow\"><td></td><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Notes</b><ul><li>Chest wall pain on deep breathing and twisting.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Exercise tolerance functions: MILD impairment</td><td>Active</td><td>14-Nov 24</td></tr><tr><td>Sports: performance COMPLETE problem</td><td>Active</td><td>--</td></tr><tr class=\"ips-follow\"><td></td><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Notes</b><ul><li>No football or other contact sport until cleared (liver injury) - mid-February 2025 at the earliest.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>School education: performance MILD problem</td><td>Active</td><td>--</td></tr><tr class=\"ips-follow\"><td></td><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Notes</b><ul><li>Missed 3 weeks of term 4; back at school with modified PE.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Immediate family: SUBSTANTIAL facilitator</td><td>Active</td><td>--</td></tr><tr class=\"ips-follow\"><td></td><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Notes</b><ul><li>Mother Michelle and grandmother closely involved.</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
